cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this reverse-engineering work, please cite it as below."
title: "JBL Wave Buds 2 — Firmware and OTA Reverse-Engineering Research"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end reverse engineering of the JBL Wave Buds 2 (Bestechnic BES1306)
  firmware and OTA update path: on-flash layout, OTA container format and CRC
  recipe, BLE/GATT command protocol, the BES TOTA v2 encrypted transport, the
  device- and app-side trust boundaries (no on-device firmware signing; no
  certificate pinning), and a reproducible owner-device firmware delivery method.
type: software
